{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52824","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 李璆","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"止足人高尚，遗荣子独前。\n诣台飞舄日，辞阙挂冠年。\n象服归丹扆，霓裳降紫天。\n仙舟望不及，朝野共推贤。\n（同前。\n原署「褒信郡王璆」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李璆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}